Course "1" -- "*" Edition : offered in
Edition "1" *-- "*" Lesson : organized into
Lesson "*" -- "*" Teacher : given by
Course "1" -- "0..1" InternalTeacher : responsible teacher
Teacher "0..*" -- "0..*" Lesson : assigned to
Lesson "*" -- "0..*" Resource : require

Edition "1" -- "*" Participant : has
Participant <|-- MasterStudent
Participant <|-- ExternalAuditor

@enduml

